WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.519
The Tree of Life tarot spread arranges ten
cards on the Kabbalistic tree.

00:00:05.519 --> 00:00:11.080
Each position becomes a plain question, read from the
practical present up to the highest aim.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.024
How the cards are laid out.

00:00:14.024 --> 00:00:16.215
The tree has three vertical columns.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:21.146
Card 1 sits at the top centre, with 2 on
the upper right and 3 on the upper left.

00:00:22.446 --> 00:00:23.554
The ten positions.

00:00:23.554 --> 00:00:27.676
Each position carries a traditional Hebrew
name, shown in brackets.

00:00:27.676 --> 00:00:31.676
The names are optional, and the questions
are what you read from.

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:35.431
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:40.205
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
